<title>JAPAN: Japan Feb housing starts fall 1.5 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Japan Feb housing starts fall 1.5 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-03-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan's housing starts in February fell 1.5 percent from a year earlier to 110,530 units, the Construction Ministry said on Monday. It was the second consecutive month of year-on-year falls.</p>
<p>					Feb starts   yr/yr pct change</p>
<p> Private homes			43,765	     +1.3</p>
<p> Rental homes			 37,364	     -5.6</p>
<p> Employee housing		    1,397	    -31.9</p>
<p> Housing built for sale	   28,004	     +2.2</p>
<p>  Condominiums			16,232	     +2.4</p>
<p> Total				 110,530	     -1.5</p>
</text>
